    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Julie Prud'homme",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117963880765923573616/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjX-UrTLyvLg0su8ZC6PdfJUV9jYuL15ciN_wa4jD3Wz2EIuTp74Tg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "At 50 years old and having seen my fare share of chiropractors, I can honestly say that Dr Stefan Ionescu is at the top of my list of the very best. Very caring, knowledgeable and very honest about treatments required. No 10 appointments/commitment needed to fix your problem. I also like that he seems to be combining a few disciplines of healing as well as chiropractic movement. He'll use massage tissues gun, hand manipulation and pressure points to relieve your pain. He's my go to Dr as a first ressources for any ailments. I very much trust his opinion and entrust him with my entire family's well-being. My son plays high level hockey and he's been treating him as a prevention and he's very aware of sports medicine to prevent further injury. The office is pleasant so is the staff at reception :) thanks for everything!",
        "time": 1729610572,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Val Tu",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101865243033353540497/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIpjSDpEtKTaPRIktJ9zGY1ErAc7gYaTIePSmzegOab787BPg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Dr Pham is not only knowledgeable, passionate and compassionate but she also seems to have magic in her hands. She has given me my hope back. Chronic pain doesn't feel like such a huge burden with her by my side. Happy dancing down the hallway for me.",
        "time": 1697244180,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jorge Martinez",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115968020012784558124/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXLvD7iEUbU9EbzMkK5SIqK4C9vUcljOYqrNZ3HhmdmL8FrP2U=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "9 years ago",
        "text": "I would highly recommend Jonathan Faust. He's really good. He takes the time to analyze your condition and treats it accordingly. Most of the time, he's even able to know where your back is hurting without you even telling him.\nHe is definitely worth going to see. You will feel a lot better afterwards.",
        "time": 1462377533,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
